2026-09-28T14:25:39.1948538Z     The ``pytest`` framework makes it easy to write small tests, yet
2026-09-28T14:25:39.1948775Z     scales to support complex functional testing for applications and libraries.
2026-09-28T14:25:39.1948863Z     
2026-09-28T14:25:39.1948981Z     An example of a simple test:
2026-09-28T14:25:39.1949070Z     
2026-09-28T14:25:39.1949175Z     .. code-block:: python
2026-09-28T14:25:39.1949266Z     
